            "action_name": {
              "value": "Material Leap"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(conjuration, teleportation)\n\nTrigger: A creature the namorrodor can sense with its lifesense on the Material Plane dies.\n\nRequirements: The namorrodor is on the Shadow Plane\n\nThe namorrodor leaps between planes, appearing on the Material Plane within 100 feet of the triggering creature. It remains on the Material Plane for 24 hours, after which it is recalled to its original location on the Shadow Plane."
            },
